digraph account_payable_process_128 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the receiving department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the receiving department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_WEEU" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"create a receiving report" -> "AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_WEEU"
		"gather the vendors invoice" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_WEEU" -> "gather the vendors invoice"
		"gather the receiving report" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_WEEU" -> "gather the receiving report"
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_YKS9" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"gather the vendors invoice" -> "AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_YKS9"
		"report errors to relevant team member" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_YKS9" -> "report errors to relevant team member"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_YKS9" -> "confirm all documents have been amended"
		"double check a three-way match" [shape=box]
		"report errors to relevant team member" -> "double check a three-way match"
		"AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_YKS9" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"double check a three-way match" -> "AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_YKS9"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" -> "AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_YKS9"
		"AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_WEEU" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_YKS9" -> "AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_WEEU"
		"gather the receiving report" -> "AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_WEEU"
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_V3VE" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_WEEU" -> "AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_V3VE"
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_V3VE" -> "enter the invoice into the accounts payable account"
		"store in paid invoice file" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_V3VE" -> "store in paid invoice file"
		"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_V3VE" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_V3VE"
		"store in paid invoice file" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_V3VE"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the receiving department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_V3VE" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the account payable process. It begins when you send to the receiving department. 
After sending to the receiving department, creating a receiving report needs to be done. 
When creating a receiving report is completed, the process is split into 2 parallel branches: gathering the vendors invoice and gathering the receiving report. 
When gathering the vendors invoice is completed, the process is split into 2 parallel branches: reporting errors to relevant team member and confirming all documents have been amended. 
After reporting errors to relevant team member, doubling check a three-way match needs to be done. 
Once all pre-tasks are executed, then the process is split into 2 parallel branches: entering the invoice into the accounts payable account and storing in paid invoice file. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the creditor process which begins when you send to the receiving department.
After receiving to the receiving department, creating a reception report needs to be done.
When a receiving report is created, the process is divided into 2 parallel branches: acquiring the vendor invoice, and assembling the receiving report.
When gathering the vendor invoice is completed, the process is split into 2 parallel branches: reporting errors to the relevant team member and confirming all documents have been modified.
After reporting errors to the appropriate team member, a three-way match needs to be checked double.
Once all pre-tasks are executed, the process is split into 2 parallel branches : entering invoices into accounts payable account and storing in paid invoice file.
The process is now complete.
"
}
